==Estonian==
{{wp|lang=et}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|et|urj-fin-pro|*acja||matter, case}}, which is of disputed origin:
* Possibly from both {{inh|et|urj-pro|*ate}} and {{m|urj-pro|*-ja}}, from {{inh|et|urj-pro|*-ja}}.
* Possibly from {{inh|et|urj-fin-pro|*asëdak||to live}}, from {{inh|et|urj-pro|*ëśe-}}.
* Possibly borrowed from {{der|et|gem-pro|*uzandiją|*(uz)andiją}}.
{{etystub|et}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{et-IPA}}
{{rfap|et}}
* {{rhymes|et|ɑsi}}
* {{hyph|et|a|si}}
* {{homophones|et|asi-}}

===Noun===
{{et-noun|asja|asja}}

# a [[thing]] {{q|that which is considered to [[exist]] as a separate [[entity]], [[object]], [[quality]] or [[concept]]}}
#: {{ux|et|terve tuba oli igasuguseid '''asju''' täis|the whole room was full of all kinds of '''things'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|naine pakkis oma '''asjad''' kokku ja läks minema|the woman packed her '''things''' and left|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|küll ta armastab ilusaid asju|he does love beautiful '''things'''|inline=1}}
## {{lb|et|chiefly|singular}} a [[thing]], [[material]], or [[substance]]; something to [[eat]] or [[drink]]
##: {{ux|et|igast '''asjast''' ei saa maja ehitada|you can't build a house out of any '''material'''|inline=1}}
##: {{ux|et|peolaud oli uhke, tekkis tahtmine kõiki '''asju''' maitsta|the party table was gorgeous, I wanted to taste '''everything'''|inline=1}}
##: {{syn|et|materjal}}
## a [[literary]] or [[artistic]] [[work]] {{q|a [[literary]], [[artistic]], or [[intellectual]] [[production]]}} {{rfex|et}}
# a [[matter]], [[business]], [[affair]]
#: {{ux|et|'''asi''' on hullem kui arvasime|the '''matter''' is worse than we thought|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|võttis koosolekul '''asja''' üles|brought the '''matter''' up at the meeting|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|ta ei saa paljudest '''asjadest''' üldse aru.|he doesn't understand many '''things''' at all|inline=1}}
## a [[cause]], [[matter]], [[business]] {{q|something concerning someone; a reason or necessity for something that conditions}}
##: {{ux|et|mis on teistel sellega '''asja''', millal mina oma töö valmis saan?|what does it '''matter''' to others, when I will finish my work?|inline=1}}
##: {{ux|et|mis see sinu '''asi''' on?|what is your '''business'''?|inline=1}}
##: {{ux|et|kas tulid niisama või oli sul '''asja''' ka?|did you just come or did you have some '''business''' to do?|inline=1}}
## an [[offence]], a [[crime]] or a [[court case]]
##: {{ux|et|'''asi''' jõudis lõpuks kohtusse|the '''case''' finally went to court|inline=1}}
##: {{syn|et|keiss}}
## a [[characteristic]] {{q|a [[distinguishing]] [[feature]] of a person or thing}}
##: {{ux|et|vanainimese asi – samm tönts, kuulmine kehv|an old person's '''characteristics''' - a stilted step, poor hearing|inline=1}}
##: {{syn|et|atribuut|pärusmaa}}
# a [[task]] or [[errand]] {{q|a [[piece]] of [[work]] done as [[part]] of one’s [[duty|duties]]}}
#: {{ux|et|mul on vaja linnas '''asju''' ajada|I need to run '''errands''' in town|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|selle '''asjaga''' pole kiiret|there is no rush for this '''task'''|inline=1}}
# something of [[value]], something [[suitable]] or [[useful]]
#: {{ux|et|sellest käsikirjast küll asja ei saa|you won't get '''anything useful''' from this manuscript|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|et|see raamat pole suurem asi|this book is no big '''deal'''|inline=1}}

