From {{inh|sq|sqj-pro|*deupa}}, from {{der|sq|ine-pro|*dʰewp-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*dʰewb-|t=deep, hollow}}. Cognate to {{cog|lt|dubùs||deep, hollow}}, {{cog|en|deep}}. {{cog|grc|δέπας||beaker, goblet}} represents a Proto-Albanian loanword.<ref>Çabej, E. 1976a. Studime Gjuhësore I, Studime Etimologjike në Fushë të Shqipes, A-O. Prishtinë: Rilindja, p.129-130</ref> According to Orel, borrowed from {{bor|sq|grc|δέπας}}.<ref>{{R:sq:Orel|page=68-69}}</ref>

===Noun===
{{sq-noun|m|djepa|djepi|djepat}}

# [[cradle]]
# [[deposit]] (of minerals etc.), [[depression]], [[dip]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|sq|det}}

===References===
<references/>

[[Category:sq:Geography]]

==Ladino==

===Etymology===
From colloquial {{der|lad|tr|cep}}, short form of [[cep telefonu]], literally ''pocket phone''.

===Noun===
{{lad-noun}}

# [[mobile phone]]
