Borrowed from a South Slavic language, compare {{cog|cu|грабити}}, {{cog|sh|grabiti||to grab, to sieze}} and {{cog|bg|грабя||to rob, to plunder}}. Ultimately from {{der|sq|sla-pro|*grabiti||to grab, to sieze}}.<ref>{{R:sq:Topalli|page=562}}</ref><ref>{{R:sq:Orel|page=121}}</ref><ref>{{R:sq:Omari|page=146}}</ref>

