===Etymology 2===

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|video games|slang|chiefly|_|''{{w|Fortnite}}''|in the plural}} {{clipping of|en|material}}
#: {{ux|en|I used up all my '''mats''' cranking 90s and ended up getting [[one-pump#Verb|one-pumped]].}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Christopher Groux|title='Fortnite' Weapon Upgrade Guide - Upgrade Bench Locations & More|work=w:Newsweek|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230330053148/https://www.newsweek.com/fortnite-weapon-upgrade-guide-bench-locations-1467511|location=New York, N.Y.|publisher=Newsweek Publishing LLC|date=24 October 2019|issn=0028-9604|oclc=1760328|passage=Using a Weapon Upgrade Bench, it's possible to upgrade a Common Shotgun, for example, all the way to Legendary provided you've harvested enough '''mats''' to do so.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Gökhan Çakır|title=Common Fortnite terms and their meanings|work=Dot Esports|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230521155716/https://dotesports.com/fortnite/news/common-fortnite-terms-and-their-meanings|date=28 November 2020|passage=While there are game modes where you can build without any requirements, you'll need to harvest materials to build in normal Fortnite games. '''''Mats''''' is the shortened version of materials.|brackets=on}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Alan Bernal|title=Viral Fortnite TikTok trick shows how to use Armored Walls for easy kills|work=Dexerto|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20211026150630/https://www.dexerto.com/fortnite/viral-fortnite-tiktok-trick-shows-how-to-use-armored-walls-for-easy-kills-1661732/|date=25 September 2021|passage=Fortnite added a new trap with the Armored Wall reinforcement for '''mats''' and one viral TikTok showed just how deadly the new item can be in a close fight.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Sarthak Chauhan|title=Fortnite YouTuber using 1000 mats in less than 30 seconds shows exactly what not to do|work=Sportskeeda|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230529203700/https://www.sportskeeda.com/fortnite/fortnite-youtuber-using-1000-mats-less-30-seconds-shows-exactly|date=16 July 2022|passage=The looper goes on laying more than a thousand '''mats''' in thirty seconds. He finally reaches his opponent, who is easily brought down with a shell of a shotgun and a burst of an SMG. Upon eliminating the opponent, he is ecstatic in celebration.}}

