#* {{quote-song|en|year=1972|author=Lou Reed|title={{w|Walk on the Wild Side (Lou Reed song)|Walk on the Wild Side}}|album=Transformer|passage=Plucked her eyebrows on the way / Shaved her legs and then he was a '''she'''}}
