According to British linguist Stuart E. Mann the etymology of {{m|sq|veri||north (wind)}} is uncertain.<ref>{{cite-book |title=An Albanian Historical Grammar |author=Stuart Edward Mann |publisher=Buske (original from the University of Michigan) |year=1977 |isbn=9783871182624 |page=86}}</ref>

