==Ancient Greek==
{{wikipedia|Names of China}}
[[File:Map after Ptolemy's Geographia (Burney MS 111, f.102r).jpeg|thumb|300px|The land of the Sinae ("ϹῗΝΑΙ") at the eastern end of the landlocked Indian Ocean in a {{circa2|1420|short=yes}} edition of {{w|Claudius Ptolemy|Ptolemy}}'s ''{{w|Geography (Ptolemy)|Geography}}''.]]

===Alternative forms===
