==Old Armenian==

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{der|xcl|xur|𒍮𒂊|tr=ṣu-e|ts=ṣûə, ṣue|t=inland sea, large lake}}. Alternatively, of {{uder|xcl|ine-pro|-}} origin, with {{cog|sga|gó||sea}} and {{cog|non|kaf}} as cognates. In the latter case the Urartian word is borrowed from Proto-Armenian. See also {{m|xcl|ծաւի}}, {{cog|xag|𐕂𐔰}}.

