==Assyrian Neo-Aramaic==
{{aii-root|ܢ ܗ ܪ}}
[[File:Limpopo.jpg|thumb|{{lang|aii|ܢܗܪܐ}}]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|aii|arc|נַהֲרָא|tr=nahărā}}, from {{der|aii|sem-pro|*nahar-|t=river}}; compare {{cog|ar|نَهْر}}, {{cog|he|נָהָר|tr=nahár}} and {{cog|akk|nārum|𒀀𒇉|tr=nārum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Standard}} {{IPA|aii|[nah.rɑː]}}
* {{a|Urmian}} {{IPA|aii|[naː.rɑː]}}

===Noun===
{{aii-noun|ܢܲܗܪܵܐ|m|pl=ܢܲܗܪܵܘܵܬܹܐ}}

# [[river]]

====Inflection====
{{aii-infl-noun-m-ircnstr-irp-irs|ܢܲܗܪ|ܢܲܗܪ|ܵܘܵܬ|ܢܗܲܪ|ܢܲܗܪ̈ܵܘܵܬ}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|aii|ܢܲܗܪܘܿܢܵܐ|t=[[rivulet]]}}
