#: {{uxi|yo|kòkó ti '''bà''' |The cocoa seeds have '''fermented'''}}
# to [[carry out]] the [[process]] of [[fermentation]] on [[seeds]] or [[plants]]

=====Usage notes=====
* '''ba''' before a direct object

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-lite|yo|iba|ìbà|act of fermenting}}
* {{l-lite|yo|idiba-nnkan|ìdíbá-nǹkan|fermentation}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{yo-IPA|bà}}

====Verb====
{{yo-verb|bà}}

# {{lb|yo|horticulture}} to [[plant]] [[seeds]] in [[prepared]] [[pots]] for [[future]] [[transplanting]] into a [[farm]] {{gl|when it becomes an established seedling}}
#: {{uxi|yo|ba '''{{l-lite|yo|orombo|òrom̀bó}}'''|To '''plant''' lemon seeds for '''future transplanting'''}}

=====Usage notes=====
* '''ba''' before a direct object

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-lite|yo|iba|ìbà}}

===Etymology 3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{yo-IPA|bà}}

====Verb====
{{yo-verb|bà}}

# to [[press]] a [[wound]]; to [[apply]] a [[warm]] [[compress]] on a [[wound]]
#: {{syn|yo|mọ́}}
#: {{uxi|yo|'''ba''' ojú egbò|To '''apply a warm compress'''  to a wound}}

=====Usage notes=====
* '''ba''' before a direct object

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-lite|yo|iba|ìbà}}

===Etymology 4===

====Pronunciation====
* {{yo-IPA|bà}}

====Verb====
{{yo-verb|bà}}

# to [[hit]] {{gl|with an impact}}
#: {{uxi|yo|ọfà á '''bà''' wọ́n|The arrow '''hit''' them}}
# to be [[overcome]] with [[fear]] {{gl|literally, to be hit with fear}}
#: {{uxi|yo|ẹ̀rú bà wá|Fear '''overcame'''  us}}
# {{lb|yo|usually used with {{l-lite|yo|ilẹ|ilẹ̀}}}} to be too [[long]] or [[oversized]] {{gl|to hit the ground}}
#: {{uxi|yo|agbádá yìí bà mí nílẹ̀|The '''agbada''' was too big for me}}
# to [[perch]]
#: {{uxi|yo|Lékeléke '''bà''' mí lékè, ẹyẹ àdàbà '''bà''' mí lékè|An egret '''perched''' on me, a dove '''perched''' on me}}
# to [[braid]]; to [[plait]]
#: {{syn|yo|dì}}

=====Usage notes=====
* '''ba''' before a direct object

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-lite|yo|iba|ìbà}}
* {{l-lite|yo|dẹru ba|dẹ́rù bà|to scare}}
* {{l-lite|yo|bẹru|bẹ̀rù|to fear}}
* {{l-lite|yo|ibẹru|ìbẹ̀rù|fear}}

