==Bashkir==
[[Image:Arm_pit_%E2%80%93_Juno.jpg|thumb|Ҡултыҡ [1]]]

===Etymology===
From ''*qoltuq'' "armpit".

Note that Chuvash and Sakha do not present any traces of this etymon, and use a different term for "armpit".

Cognate with
{{cog|kk|қолтық|t=armpit}},
{{cog|ky|колтук|t=armpit}},
{{cog|uz|qoʻltiq|t=armpit}},
{{cog|ug|قولتۇق|t=armpit}},
{{cog|kjh|холтых|t=armpit}},
{{cog|tyv|колдук|t=armpit}},
{{cog|tr|koltuk|t=armchair}}, {{cog|tr|koltuk altı|t=armpit}}, etc.

===Pronunciation===
