===Etymology 1===
A derivation of {{inh|ba|trk-pro|*ȫŕ}}.
Compare {{cog|ky|өзөк|t=core, pivot}},
{{cog|krc|ёзёк|tr=özök|t=core, pivot}},
dialectal {{cog|tr|özek|t=center}},
{{cog|sah|үөс|үөс|t=center, core}}.

====Noun====
{{ba-noun}}

# [[center]]
#: {{ux|ba|Ҡала '''үҙәге'''.|translation='''Center''' of the city, downtown.}}
#: {{ux|ba|Ауырлыҡ '''үҙәге'''.|translation='''Center''' of gravity.}}
# [[core]]
# [[central]] [[point]]; [[focus]], [[hub]], [[linchpin]]
#: {{ux|ba|Район идаралығы алмашынғас ҡына, кесе эшҡыуарлыҡ проблемалары ниһайәт иғтибар '''үҙәгенә''' килеп баҫты.|translation=''(It was)'' only when the district management changed ''(that)'' the problems of micro-entrepreneurship finally came '''into''' the '''center''' of attention ''(=into the spotlight)''.}}
# {{lb|ba|religion}} [[soul]], [[heart]]
#: {{ux|ba|'''Үҙәгем''' өҙөлөп тыуған ауылымды һағынам.|translation=I miss my native village ''(so much that)'' '''my heart''' bleeds.}}

=====Declension=====
{{ba-noun-c|ә|к}}

====Adjective====
{{head|ba|adjective}}

# [[central]]
#: {{ux|ba|'''Үҙәк''' гәзит.|translation='''Central''' newspaper ''(=published in the capital)''.}}
# [[main]], [[core]]; [[crucial]], [[pivotal]]
#: {{ux|ba|'''Үҙәк''' мәсьәлә.|translation='''Central''' problem.}}

===Etymology 2===
