===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|quarte}}, {{m|enm|querte}}, from {{der|en|non|kyrt}}, {{m|non|*kvirt}}, neuter of {{der|en|non|kyrr}}, {{m|non|kvirr|t=quiet, still, peaceful}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*kwerruz|t=calm, satisfied, pacified}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʷerh₂-|t=heavy}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|quert}}, {{m|sco|quart|t=alive, in good health, sound}}, {{cog|sco|querty|t=vivacious, active, in good spirits}}, {{cog|da|kvær|t=quiet}}, {{cog|nn|kvar}}, {{m|nn|kvær}}, {{m|nn|kverr|t=still, quiet}}, {{cog|is|kyrr|t=still, calm, unmoving}}.

