====Definitions====
{{zh-hanzi}}

# to [[replace]]; to [[take]] the [[place]] of
# to [[act]] for; to do something on [[behalf]] of
# to [[act]] as; to be the [[acting]] (president etc.)
# [[generation]]; [[age]] [[group]]
# [[historical]] [[period]]; [[era]]
# [[date]]; [[age]]
# [[dynasty]]; [[line]] of [[ruler]]s
# {{lb|zh|geology}} [[era]] {{gl|[[geochronologic]] unit}}
# {{lb|zh|grammar}} {{zh-short|代名詞|dot=;}} {{zh-short|代詞|[[pronoun]]|nocap=y}}
# {{lb|zh|historical|_|geography}} {{zh-short|代國|[[state]] of [[Dai]]}}
# {{surname|zh}}

=====Synonyms=====
