==Japanese==

===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|ja|sōgen}}
{{ja-kanjitab|そう|げん|yomi=on,kanon}}

Might be a {{lbor|ja|zh|sort=そうげん|nocap=1|草原}}. Alternatively, it might be a reanalysis of {{m|ja|[[草原#Japanese:_kusahara|草原]]|tr=kusahara}}, applying the expected ''[[on'yomi]]'' to the spelling to imbue the term with a higher [[register#English:_language register|register]].

First cited with this ''sōgen'' reading to a newspaper article published in 1871.<ref name="KDJ2">{{R:Nihon Kokugo Daijiten 2}}</ref>

