===Etymology 1===
{{ja-kanjitab|かど|yomi=k}}
From {{inh|ja|ojp|-|sort=かど}},<ref name="KDJ2">{{R:Nihon Kokugo Daijiten 2|角・稜}}</ref> in turn, from {{inh|ja|jpx-pro|*kanto|sort=かど}}.

