==Classical Syriac==

===Etymology===
From {{m|syc|ܓܙܪܬܐ|tr=gāzartāʾ||island}}, from the root {{syc-root-entry|ܓ|ܙ|ܪ}} related to cutting off + {{m|syc|ܝܒܫܢܝܬܐ|tr=yaḇšānāytāʾ}}, feminine form of {{m|syc|ܝܒܫܢܝܐ|tr=yaḇšānāyāʾ||terrestrial}}, from the root {{syc-root-entry|ܝ|ܒ|ܫ}} related to dryness.

===Pronunciation===
