From the root {{syc-root-entry|ܡ|ܢ|ܐ}} related to counting. Compare {{cog|he|מָנָה|tr=mānâ}}. The sense of "particle" is a {{semantic loan|syc|grc|μόριον|nocap=1}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|syc|[m(ə)nɑθɑ(ʔ)]}}

====Noun====
