==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Etymology 1===
From the verb {{m|nn|rose|rosa|t=to praise}}, from {{der|nn|non|hrósa}}. Prior to the [[WT:Norwegian Nynorsk spelling reforms#1959|spelling reform of 1959]], this noun was considered grammatically feminine or neuter. The revision made non-standard the definite singular forms {{m|nn|rosa}}, {{m|nn|rosi}}{{,}} and {{m|nn|roset}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|nn|/ruːs/}} {{nn-pronu-note}}

====Noun====
{{nn-noun-mu}}

# {{senseid|nn|praise}} {{l|en|praise}}
#* {{quote-book|nn|year=1875|author=w:Elias Blix|title=Nokre Salmar|trans-title=Some hymns|edition=3rd|page=25|chapter=Med Jesus|text=Det er mi høgste Æra, // det er mi største '''Ros''' // hans Fylgjesvein at vera // og vandra i hans Ljos.|translation=It is my highest honour, // it is my highest '''praise''': // to be a His disciple // and wander in His light.}}
#* {{quote-book|nn|year=1992|author=Arne Ruset|title=Den svarte kista|pages=85–86|text=Sophies Minde vart flau av all '''rosen''', og gav noko nebbete uttrykk for at no heldt det lenge.|translation=Sophies Minde got embarrassed by all '''the praise''', and expressed somewhat snarkily that this would be enough for a good while.}}

====Verb====
{{head|nn|verb form}}

# {{infl of|nn|rose|rosa|imp}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|nn|non|rǫs}}, plural of {{m|non|ras|g=n}}, whence also the more common {{doublet|nocap=1|nn|ras}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|nn|ròs}} {{q|alternative spelling}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|nn|/roːs/}} {{nn-pronu-note}}

====Noun====
{{nn-noun-f1}}

# {{senseid|nn|landslide}} an [[avalanche]], a [[landslide]], a [[slip]]
#: {{syn|nn|skred}}
# [[cavity]] left in place of the masses displaced by such an avalanche, landslide or other
# {{senseid|nn|scratch}} a [[scratch]] in the [[skin]]

===Etymology 3===
[[File:Facial_erysipelas.jpg|thumb|''mann med '''ros''' i andletet'']]
After {{bor|nn|de|Rose}}, from {{der|nn|goh|rōsa}}, from {{der|nn|la|rosa}}. {{doublet|nn|rose}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|nn|/ruːs/}} {{nn-pronu-note}}

====Noun====
{{nn-noun-fu}}

# {{senseid|nn|erysipelas}} {{lb|nn|disease}} [[erysipelas]]
#: {{syn|nn|rosen|q1=more common}}

===References===
* {{R:ND}}

