==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{m|cs|hydra}}, from {{der|cs|grc|ὕδρα}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɪdra|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|Hyd|ra}}

===Proper noun===
{{cs-proper noun|f}}

# {{lb|cs|Greek mythology|Roman mythology}} {{l|en|Hydra}}, a mythological [[serpent]] with seven [[head]]s
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1996 |author=w:Antonín Rükl|title=Souhvězdí |chapter=Hydra |page=126 |publisher=Aventinum |location=Praha |url= |isbn=80-7151-051-3 |passage={{...}} místo každé uťaté hlavy vyrostly '''Hydře''' dvě nové. |translation={{...}} instead of every cut-off head two new heads grew up to '''Hydra'''.}}
# {{lb|cs|constellation}} {{l|en|Hydra}}, a [[spring]] [[constellation]] of the [[northern]] sky
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1996 |author=w:Antonín Rükl|title=Souhvězdí |chapter=Hydra |page=126 |publisher=Aventinum |location=Praha |url= |isbn=80-7151-051-3 |passage=Alfa Hydrae – Alphard, 2,0 mag, je nejjasnější hvězda v '''Hydře'''. |translation=Alpha Hydrae – Alphard, 2.0 mag, is the brightest star in the constellation of '''Hydra'''.}}
# {{lb|cs|astronomy}} {{l|en|Hydra}}, a [[moon]] of [[Pluto]] {{defdate|since 2006}}
#* {{quote-journal|cs|author=Petr Lála|title=Historická událost: sonda New Horizons zblízka prozkoumá záhadné Pluto|journal=Technet.cz|url=https://technet.idnes.cz/new-horizon-u-pluta-04k-/tec_vesmir.aspx?c=A150710_135732_vojenstvi_kuz|date=2015-06-12|passage=Měsíce '''Hydra''', Nix a Styx obíhají ve vzájemné rezonanci, protože za jeden oběh '''Hydry''' oběhne Nix právě jeden a půlkrát a Styx dokonce dvakrát.|translation=The moons '''Hydra''', Nix and Styx orbit in mutual resonance, as Nix makes exactly one and half an orbit and Styx even two orbits during one orbit of '''Hydra'''.}}
# {{l|en|Hydra}}, one of the [[Saronic Islands]] of [[Greece]] in the [[Aegean Sea]]
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1904 |author= |title=Ottův slovník naučný| volume=XXI |chapter=Řecko |page=359 |publisher=J. Ottl |location=Praha |url=http://archive.org/stream/ottvslovnknauni35ottogoog#page/n406/mode/2up |passage=Poloostrov Argolský, k němuž přiléhá ostrov '''Hydra''' (Hydrea), omezuje záliv Nauplijský{{...}} |translation=The Argolid Penninsula, which the island of '''Hydra''' (Hydrea) closely borders with, closes the Argolic Gulf{{...}}}}

