==Catalan==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|pas}}, from {{inh|ca|la|passus||step}}. Its use as an auxiliary adverb comes from an accusative use (Latin {{m|la|[[nec]]…[[passum]]}}) in negative constructions – literally ‘not…a step’, i.e. ‘not at all’ – originally used with certain verbs of motion. Compare similarly used {{cog|fr|pas}}. Cognate with {{cog|gl,es|paso}} and {{cog|pt|passo}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|#sos}}

# [[pace]], [[step]]
# {{lb|ca|historical|measure}} [[paso]], [[Spanish]] [[pace]], {{ngd|a traditional unit of length}}
# {{lb|ca|figuratively}} [[pace]], [[action]]
# [[pace]], [[gait]], [[rhythm]] of [[walking]]

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|ca|passa}}

=====Coordinate terms=====
* {{sense|unit of length}} {{l|ca|peu}} {{q|⅕ pas}}, {{l|ca|vara}} {{q|⅗ pas}}, {{l|ca|braça}} {{q|1⅕ pas}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|passet}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ca|passar}}

====Adverb====
{{ca-adv}}

# {{lb|ca|in negative sentences}} {{ngd|used to intensify negation:}} [[at all]], [[ever]]
#: {{uxi|ca|No feu '''pas''' això|Do not '''ever''' do this}}
#: {{uxi|ca|No serà '''pas''' important.|It won't matter.|lit=It won't be '''so''' important.}}

=====Usage notes=====
The main marker of negation in Catalan is the adverb {{m|ca|no}}. ''No'' is placed before the verbs, while {{m|ca|pas}} is usually placed after it. Unlike Occitan or French, where {{m|oc|pas}} and {{m|fr|pas}} is a mandatory negative particle (under many circumstances); in Catalan, {{m|ca|pas}} is only used as an optional intensifier of negation. However, some northern dialects use "pas" instead of "no" as the mandatory negative particle. Also, in many dialects "pas" has totally disappeared.

===Etymology 2===
{{deverbal|ca|passar}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|#sos}}

# [[passing]]
# [[crossing]]
#: {{uxi|ca|'''pas''' zebra|zebra '''crossing'''}}
# [[passage]]
#: {{uxi|ca|ritu de '''pas'''|rite of '''passage'''}}
# [[pitch]] {{gloss|distance between evenly spaced objects}}
#: {{uxi|ca|'''pas''' de rosca}}
#: {{uxi|ca|'''pas''' polar}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|de pas}}
* {{l|ca|pas a nivell}}
* {{l|ca|pas de vianants}}
* {{l|ca|pas zebra}}

