===Etymology 2===
Possibly borrowed and adapted from {{bor|id|nl|pas}}, a deverbal from {{m|nl|passen}}, from {{inh|nl|dum|passen}}, from {{m|dum|pas}}, from {{der|nl|fro|pas}}, from {{der|nl|la|passus}}. Therefore related to etymology 1.

====Adverb====
{{id-adv}}

# {{lb|id|colloquial|nonstandard}} [[only]], not until, not any [[soon]]er
#: {{usex|nl|Simpan aja dulu, belinya nanti '''pas''' gajian|Just keep it first, purchase it later '''only''' at the payday}}<ref name="Keep It First">“[https://bekasi.urbanjabar.com/tekno/amp/3118750903/simpan-aja-dulu-belinya-nanti-pas-gajian-chek-rekomendasi-hp-5-jutaan-terbaik-bulan-mei Keep It First]”, ''[https://bekasi.urbanjabar.com/ Urban Bekasi]''</ref>
# {{lb|id|colloquial|nonstandard}} [[when]], at the time of
#: {{usex|nl|Pada saat puasa Ramadhan, banyak yang bertanya mengenai sahur '''pas''' imsak, apa boleh?|When fasting during [[Ramadan]], many have questioned regarding doing [[suhur]] '''at the time of''' [[imsak]]; would such action be permissible?}}<ref name="sahur">“[https://www.cnnindonesia.com/gaya-hidup/20230406132933-284-934422/makan-sahur-pas-imsak-apa-masih-boleh/amp Suhur During Imsak]”, ''[https://www.cnnindonesia.com/ CNN Indonesia]''</ref>

