===Etymology 2===
From {{inh-lite|en|enm|arm||poor, wretched}}, from {{inh-lite|en|ang|sc=Latnx|earm||poor, miserable, pitiful, wretched}}, from {{inh-lite|en|gmw-pro|sc=Latnx|*arm}}, from {{inh-lite|en|gem-pro|sc=Latnx|*armaz||poor}}, from {{der-lite|en|ine-pro|sc=Latnx|*h₁erm-||poor, ill}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Akin to {{cog-lite|nl|arm||poor}}, {{cog-lite|de|arm||poor}}, {{cog-lite|yi|sc=Hebr|אָרעם||tr=orem|poor}}, {{cog-lite|sv|arm||poor}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

