From {{inh-lite|cim|gmh|arm}}, from {{inh-lite|cim|goh|arm}}, from {{inh-lite|cim|gmw-pro|sc=Latnx|*arm}}, from {{inh-lite|cim|gem-pro|sc=Latnx|*armaz||poor, pitiful}}. Cognate with {{cog-lite|de|arm}}, {{cog-lite|en|arm}}.

