====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To deal with a bank or [[financial]] [[institution]], or for an institution to provide financial services to a client.
#: {{ux|en|He '''banked''' with Barclays.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1979|author=Douglas Adams|title=The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy|passage=the sort of face you would happily '''bank''' with}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To put into a bank.
#: {{ux|en|I'm going to '''bank''' the money.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|slang}} To [[conceal]] in the [[rectum]] for use in [[prison]].
#: {{ux|en|Johnny '''banked''' some coke for me.}}

