# Akin to {{cog-lite|grc|sc=Polyt|φάρμακον||tr=phármakon|drug, medicine}}, from a tentative common {{der|sq|ine-pro|-}} root {{m|ine-pro|*bʰer-|t=cure with herbs}}.<ref>{{R:ine:EIEC|262|head=?*bher}}</ref><ref>{{R:sq:Çabej St.|vol=1|page=54}}</ref>
# From {{der|sq|ine-pro|*bʰuH-|*bʰewH-|t=to grow}}, whence also {{cog|grc|φυτόν|t=plant}}, {{cog|xcl|բոյս|t=plant}}.<ref>{{R:sq:Demiraj:1997|pages=89–90}}</ref>
{{senseno|sq|marijuana|uc=1}} is likely a {{sl|sq|nocap=1|en|weed}}, {{sl|sq|notext=1|fr|herbe}} or {{sl|sq|notext=1|it|erba}}.

