#* {{quote-book|en|year=2022|section=Part I. The New Deal Order, 1930–1980|chapter=1|author=w:Gary Gerstle|publisher=Oxford University Press|title=The Rise and Fall of the Neoliberal Order{{...|: America and the World in the Free Market Era}}|location=New York|isbn=978-0-19-751964-6|passage=Over the course of his [Eisenhower's] two terms in office, his administration's expenditures on public works actually exceeded those of '''FDR''' and Truman.}}
