#* {{quote-book|en|year=2022|title={{w|The Candy House (novel)|The Candy House}}|author=w:Jennifer Egan|passage=He mounted its stairs and crossed the '''FDR''' to find the park transformed since he'd last seen it: There were sculpted bushes and a picturesque little bridge and joggers still out, even at this hour.}}
