====Noun====
[[Image:Kilt_stitching_001.jpg|thumb|right|125px|The fell, or stitched down portion of a kilt]]
{{en-noun}}

# A cutting-down of timber.
# The [[stitching]] down of a fold of cloth; specifically, the portion of a [[kilt]], from the waist to the seat, where the [[pleat]]s are stitched down.
# {{lb|en|textiles}} The end of a [[web]], formed by the last [[thread]] of the [[weft]].

