{{en-noun|-|+}}

# {{lb|en|sciences|geography}} The [[discipline]] which deals with the measurement and representation of {{l|en|Earth}}, its {{l|en|gravitational}} field and {{l|en|geodynamic}} phenomena (polar motion, Earth tides, and crustal motion) in three-dimensional, time-varying space

