|caption2 = A [[postcard]] of an ice gorge (''sense 4'') on the {{w|Mississippi River}}, USA{{refn|group=n|name=n1|From the [[w:V. O. Hammon Publishing Company|V. O. Hammon]] Collection of the {{w|Newberry Library}} in [[Chicago]], [[Illinois]], USA.}}
