|image5 = NIE 1905 Fishing - primeval stone and bronze gorges.jpg
|caption5 = Drawings of [[primeval]] [[fishing#Noun|fishing]] gorges ''(sense 7)'', two made of [[stone#Noun|stone]] ''(above)'' and two of [[bronze#Noun|bronze]]{{refn|group=n|name=n2|From {{cite-book|entry=Fishing|editors={{w|Daniel Coit Gilman}}, {{w|Harry Thurston Peck}}, and {{w|Frank Moore Colby}}|title=[[w:New International Encyclopedia|The New International Encyclopædia]]|location=New York, N.Y.|publisher={{w|Dodd, Mead & Co.}}|year=1905|volume=7|page=676|oclc=1049897922}}.}}
