====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# The left side or direction.
#: {{syn|en|9 o'clock|port}}
# {{lb|en|politics}} The [[left-wing]] [[political]] [[party|parties]] as a [[group]]; [[citizen]]s [[hold]]ing [[left-wing]] [[view]]s as a [[group]].
#: {{ux|en|The '''Left''' left workers behind, thinking they had a winning demographic coalition. It hasn't really worked out for them yet.}}
# The left hand or fist.
# {{lb|en|boxing}} A [[punch]] delivered with the left fist.
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1915|year_published=1916|author=w:C.J. Dennis|title=w:The Songs of a Sentimental Bloke|page=13|text=The world 'as got me snouted jist a treat; Crool Forchin's dirty '''left''' 'as smote me soul.}}
# {{lb|en|surfing}} A [[wave]] breaking from left to right (viewed from the shore).
#: {{antonyms|en|right}}

