===Etymology===
From {{inh|yol|enm|lift|left}}, from {{inh|yol|ang|lyft}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|yol|adjective}}

# [[#English|left]]
#* {{quote-book|yol|year=1927|chapter=ZONG OF TWI MAARKEET MOANS|line=11|title=THE ANCIENT DIALECT OF THE BARONIES OF FORTH AND BARGY, COUNTY WEXFORD|passage=In durk Ich red virst mee '''left'''-vooted shoe."|translation=In the dark I happened first on my '''left'''-footed shoe."}}

