{{wp}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|localité}}, from {{der|en|LL.|-}} {{m|la|localitas}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|local|ity}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/loʊˈkæl.ɪ.ti/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ləʊˈkæl.ɪ.ti/}}
