* Japanese: {{t+|ja|経絡|tr=けいらく, keiraku}}, {{t+|ja|経絡系|tr=けいらくけい, keirakukei}}
* Persian: {{t|fa|مریدین|tr=meridiyan}}
* Portuguese: {{t+|pt|meridiano|m}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|меридиа́н|m}}
{{trans-bottom}}

