===Etymology 2===
The pronunciation is that of {{m|de||MPi}}, the Wehrmacht abbreviation. The now predominant spelling was influenced by the {{w|MP5}} and by {{der|de|en|-}} usage (the spoken form being maintained through reinterpretation as an English reading of the letters).

