===Etymology===
cf. {{m|en|Pacific}}. Portuguese explorer [[w:Ferdinand_Magellan|Magellan]] called the ocean {{m|pt|pacífico|gloss=peaceful}} (in c. 1519) because, after sailing through the stormy seas off [[Cape Horn]], the expedition found calm waters<ref>{{pedia}}</ref>.

