* Greek: {{t+|el|στραγγίζω}}
* Malay: {{t|ms|mendulang}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|промыва́ть|impf}}, {{t+|ru|промы́ть|pf}}
{{trans-bottom}}

{{trans-top|to criticise severely|id=criticize}}
