#* {{quote-song|en|year=2015|title=Its '''Peak'''| artist={{w|Tinie Tempah}} (featuring {{w|Stormzy}} and {{w|Bugzy Malone}})| passage=When they're tryna get the girl to the crib and she leaves, it's '''peak''' / Tryna keep it discreet and she tweets, it's '''peak''' / See me rolling with 20 man deep, it's '''peak''' / Yo rudeboy, pull up, repeat, it's '''peak'''}}
#* {{quote-av|en|year=2023|writer=w:Nathan Bryon; Tom Melia|director=w:Raine Allen-Miller|actor=w:David Jonsson|role=Dom|title=w:Rye Lane|text=Tempting, but I think it's actually something I need to do. Like, I get what they did was '''peak''', but I have to take some responsibility, you know?}}
# {{lb|en|MLE}} [[unlucky|Unlucky]]; [[unfortunate]].
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:unlucky}}
#: {{ux|en|You didn't get a spot? That's '''peak'''.}}

