* {{sense|immediately|directly}} {{l|en|right smack}}, {{l|en|slap-bang}}
* {{sense|very|extremely}} {{l|en|ever so}}; see also [[Thesaurus:very]]
* {{sense|according to fact or truth}} {{l|en|in point of fact}}, {{l|en|in truth}}; see also [[Thesaurus:actually]]
* {{sense|correct manner}} {{l|en|correctly}}, {{l|en|properly}}

