# {{lb|en|geography}} The [[parallel]] of [[latitude]] 23°30′[[south]] of the [[equator]], marking the [[southern]] boundary of the [[tropics]]; the [[sun]] is directly [[overhead]] at the [[December solstice]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|Tropic of Cancer}}

