===Verb===
{{en-verb|pres_ptc2=targetting|past2=targetted}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To aim something, especially a weapon, at (a target).
# {{lb|en|transitive|figuratively}} To aim for as an [[audience]] or [[demographic]].
#: ''The advertising campaign '''targeted''' older women.''
# {{lb|en|transitive|computing}} To produce [[code]] suitable for.
#: ''This cross-platform compiler can '''target''' any of several processors.''

