{{eo-head}}

# {{lb|eo|geography}} [[abyss]]
# {{lb|eo|figuratively}} [[oblivion]]
# {{lb|eo|figuratively}} [[gulf]], [[irreconcilable]] [[difference]]
#: {{ux|eo|Inter niaj opinioj estas '''abismo'''.|There is a '''vast gulf''' between our opinions.}}

{{eo 1OA}}

