From {{inh-lite|is|non|á||river}}, from {{inh-lite|is|gem-pro|sc=Latnx|*ahwō}}, from {{inh-lite|is|ine-pro|sc=Latnx|*h₂ekʷeh₂||water}}. Compare {{cog-lite|da|å}}, {{cog-lite|no|å}}, {{cog-lite|sv|å}}.

====Noun====
