From {{inh-lite|non|gmq-pro|sc=Runr|ᚨᚾ|tr=an}}, from {{inh-lite|non|gem-pro|sc=Latnx|*ana||on, onto}}. Cognate with {{cog-lite|ang|on}}, {{cog-lite|ofs|on}}, {{cog-lite|osx|ana}}, {{m-lite|osx|an}}, {{cog-lite|odt|ana}}, {{m-lite|odt|an}}, {{m-lite|odt|in}}, {{cog-lite|goh|ana}}, {{m-lite|goh|an}}, {{cog-lite|got|sc=Goth|𐌰𐌽𐌰|tr=ana}}.

