==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/aɪˈbɪəɹ.i.ə/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/aɪˈbɪəɹ.i.ə/|/aɪˈbɪɹ.i.ə/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Iberia.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪəɹiə|ɪɹiə|s=4}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|en|la|Iberia}}, from {{der|en|grc|Ἰβηρία|}}, after the river {{m|grc|Ἴβηρος|}}, which itself came from a native {{der|en|xce|-}} name for the river {{m|xce|*Ibēr}} (modern {{cog|es|Ebro}}).

{{pedia|Iberian Peninsula|Iberia}}

====Proper noun====
{{en-proper noun}}

