|passage=A més, 3.500 persones han passat per les sales de consum ateses per professionals, on '''cap''' de les 214 sobredosis ha estat mortal.
|t=Additionally, 3,500 people have passed through the [drug] use rooms tended by professionals, where '''none''' of the 214 overdoses has been fatal.
|url=http://www.elpuntavui.cat/societat/article/14-salut/1653041-la-demanda-de-tractament-per-deixar-la-cocaina-creix.html}}
