===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|estreito}}, from {{inh|pt|la|strictus}}. Compare {{cog|es|estrecho}} and {{cog|fr|étroit}}. {{doublet|pt|estrito}}, which was a borrowing.

