==Dutch==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nl|kaai}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|cade}}, later also {{m|dum|caey}}, from a {{der|nl|cel|-}} word for "field, hedge," from {{der|nl|cel-pro|*kagyom|t=enclosure}}. The word may have been borrowed through {{der|nl|fro|cai}}.<ref>{{R:nl:Etymologiebank|kade1}}</ref>

A hypercorrection of {{m|nl|kaai}}, as the original word was thought to have contained ''-d-'', which tends to be replaced by ''-j-'' in many words.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈkaː.də/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-kade.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|ka|de}}
* {{rhymes|nl|aːdə|s=2}}
* {{homophones|nl|Kade}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|f|-s|pl2=-en|kadetje}}

# [[quay]], [[wharf]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nl|kademuur}}

===References===
<references/>

