===Noun===
{{id-noun|head=dêrajat|pl=-}}

# [[degree]]:
## social standing: a stage of rank or privilege.
##: {{syn|id|martabat|pangkat|tingkatan}}
## {{lb|id|education}} a stage of proficiency or qualification in a course of study, now especially an award bestowed by a university or, in some countries, a college, as a certification of academic achievement.
## {{lb|id|geometry}} a unit of [[measurement]] of [[angle]] equal to {{frac|1|360}} of a [[circle]]'s circumference.
## {{lb|id|physics}} a unit of measurement of [[temperature]] on any of several [[scales]], such as [[Celsius]] or [[Fahrenheit]].
##: {{uxi|id|Suhu permukaan rata-rata planet ini telah meningkat sekitar 2 derajat Fahrenheit (1 '''derajat''' Celsius) sejak akhir abad ke-19.|This planet surface temperature has been increasing about 2 degrees Fahrenheit (1 '''degree''' Celcius) since end of 19th century.|ref=<ref>{{cite-journal|id|author=Hendrik Khoirul Muhid|title=Apa Efek Kenaikan Suhu Bumi Meski Cuma 1,5 Derajat Celsius?|work=Tempo|pageurl=https://tekno.tempo.co/read/1565994/apa-efek-kenaikan-suhu-bumi-meski-cuma-15-derajat-celsius|date=01 March 2022|location=Jakarta}}</ref>}}
## {{lb|id|geography}} a unit of [[measurement]] of [[latitude]] and [[longitude]] which together identify a [[location]] on the [[Earth]]'s surface.
## the amount that an entity possesses a certain property; relative [[intensity]], [[extent]].
# [[level]], [[rank]]
#: {{syn|id|martabat|pangkat|tingkatan}}

