==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|la|montāna|montānea}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|la|mons|alt1=mont-|t1=mountain|-ānia|pos2=collective noun-forming suffix}}, the latter from the neuter plural of Latin {{m|la|-āneus|pos=adjective-forming suffix}}. Cf. the development of {{m|LL.|campānia|t=countryside}} < {{m|la|campus|t=field}}. Sense 1 appears to be the original one, judging by the word's construction.

Attested in the eighth-century {{w|Reichenau Glossary}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Proto-Romance}} {{IPA|la|/monˈtanʲa/}}
* {{a|Proto-Gallo-Romance}} {{IPA|la|/monˈtaɲa/}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|montānia<1>}} {{tlb|la|EML.}}

# [[mountainous]] [[area]]
# [[mountain]]
#* {{quote-text|la|year=1035|title=Testamentum Guifredi Comitis Cerritanensis
|passage=Et ipsa '''montania''' relinquo filio meo Berengario...
|translation=And I leave [ownership of] the '''mountain''' to my son Berengar...}}

====Declension====
{{la-ndecl|montānia<1>}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|LL.|montāniōsus}}

