===Etymology 1===
From {{der|ga|mga|corr|t=protruding, pointed}}, from {{der|ga|cel-pro|*kurros|t=pointed, angled}}, possibly ultimately from {{der|ga|ine-pro|*(s)ker-|t=bend, curve}}, if the development were similar to {{m|ine-pro||*kew-ro-}} >> {{m|ine-pro||*ku-ro-}} >> {{cog|cel-pro||*kur-so-}} >> {{m|cel-pro|*kurros|t=pointed, angled}}; see also {{cog|la|curvus}}.  Cognate with {{cog|cy|cwr|t=corner, edge}}.<ref>{{R:cel:Matasovic 2009|230|head=*kurro-}}</ref>

====Noun====
{{ga-noun|f|coirre|corra}}

# projecting [[point]]
# [[angle]], [[edge]]
# [[hollow]], [[pit]]
# rounded [[hill]], [[hump]]

=====Declension=====
{{ga-decl-f2|c|orr|oirre}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ga|corr shúgáin}}
* {{l|ga|corr chasta}}
* {{l|ga|corradh}}

====Adjective====
{{ga-adjective|gsm=corr|gsf=coirre|comp=coirre|pl=corra}}

# [[odd]]
# [[tapering]], [[pointed]]
# [[round]], [[curved]]

=====Declension=====
{{ga-decl-adj|c|orr|gsf=oirre|pl=~a}}

=====Derived terms=====
