#* {{quote-book|en|year=2001|author=Sally de Dear|title=The House on Pig Island|url=http://books.google.com.au/books?id=ZoEWGZqF-CAC&pg=PA8&dq=%22port%22%7C%22ports%22+schoolbag+australia+OR+queensland+-intitle:%22%22+-inauthor:%22%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=2Z3lT_KvOqKsiAe98KxY&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q=%22port%22%7C%22ports%22%20schoolbag%20australia%20OR%20queensland%20-intitle%3A%22%22%20-inauthor%3A%22%22&f=false|page=8|passage=As they left the classroom, Jennifer pointed at the shelves lining the veranda. “Put your '''port''' in there.”<br>“What?” asked Penny.<br>“Your '''port''' - your school bag, silly. It goes in there.”}}
