====Noun====
{{it-noun|m|braccia|pl_g=f|pl_qual=in most meanings|pl2=bracci|pl2_g=m|pl2_qual=in the figurative meanings "branch (of a railway/railroad or river), wing (of a building), arm (of a cross, crane, of scales), strait, isthmus"|dim=braccìno,braccétto|aug=braccióne|dim_aug=bracciòtto<t:chubby little arm>}}

# [[arm]]
