# [[branch]] {{q|of a river or railway/railroad}}
# [[wing]] {{q|of a building}}

=====Usage notes=====
* In senses 1 through 4, the plural form used is {{m|it|braccia}}, derived from {{cog|la|bracchia}}, the ancient neuter plural of {{m|la|bracchium}}. In the remaining senses the plural is derived regularly from the Italian masculine plural ending ''-i'' and is thus {{m|it|bracci}}.

