# a horn-shaped amulet worn to ward off evil

====Usage notes====
* The feminine plural {{m|it|corna}} is used only in the zoological meaning of the term as an alternative form of {{m|it|corni}}.
*: {{m|it|corni|'''corni''' di pecora|goat's '''horns'''}}
*: {{m|it|corna|'''corna''' di pecora|goat's '''horns'''}}
* For other meanings use the masculine plural {{m|it|corni}}.
*: {{m|it|corni francesi|'''corni''' francesi|French '''horns'''}}
*: {{m|it|corni inglesi|'''corni''' inglesi|'''cors''' anglais; English '''horns'''}}

