==Albanian==

===Etymology===
Singularized plural of *vallë, from {{inh|sq|sqj-pro|*walwā}}, a derivative of {{inh|sq|ine-pro|*wel-||to turn, wind, round}}. Close to {{cog|la|volvō||to roll}}<ref>Çabej, E. 1976a. Studime Gjuhësore II, Studime Etimologjike në Fushë të Shqipes, Prishtinë: Rilindja, p. 265-266</ref> {{cog|grc|εἰλύω||to roll up, wrap}}. See {{l|sq|vjell}} and {{l|sq|vjel}}.

===Noun===
{{sq-noun|f|valle|vallja|vallet}}

# folk [[dance]] (people holding each other's hands and going in circle)
# [[group]] (of objects or people sitting in circle for council, debating etc)
# a difficult or annoying [[enterprise]]

