From {{inh|mn|xgn-pro|*aral|id=shaft|t=shaft of a cart}}, compare {{cog|xgn-mgl}}, {{cog|dta|alle}}. Non-cart related senses seem exclusive to modern Mongolian and might derive from a different etymon.

