==Mongolian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|mn|xng|ᠱᠦᠯᠡᠨ}}, from {{inh|mn|xgn-pro|*silö||meat broth, soup}}, probably deriving from or otherwise related with {{der|mn|trk-pro|*söl|t=[[juice]]}}.

Compare {{cog|sce|shulie|t=[[broth]]}}, {{cog|kk|сөл}} and possible {{cog|tuw}} cognates such as {{cog|gld|чо̄лон|tr=čōlon|t=soup}} and {{cog|mnc|ᠰᡳᠯᡝ|t=soup}}. Compare also {{cog|tr|şölen}}, which is a Mongolic loan.

===Noun===
{{mn-noun|m|ᠱᠥᠯᠦ}}

# [[soup]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|mn|шөл гаргах}}, {{l|mn|шөл уух|lit=to throw soup, to drink soup|t=to [[slaughter]] cattle}}

