==Latin==
{{wikipedia|lang=la}}

===Etymology===
From the plural of {{m|la|castellum|t=castle, fort, citadel}}, diminutive of {{m|la|castrum|t=fortress}}, reportedly in reference to the central region of {{l|la|Hispānia}} as {{m|la|[[terra]] [[castellorum]]|t=land of castles}}.

