# {{lb|en|British|slang}} A [[woman]], especially when older or unattractive.
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Michael Holden|title=Michael Holden's All ears|work=The Guardian|date=2008-06-27|url=https://www.theguardian.com/music/2008/jun/28/clubs.guidefeatures1|issn=0261-3077|passage=Fella at work, right? He's met this '''Doris''' on a park bench, at lunch time, and he's started going out on like, dates with her!}}

