{{inh+|tr|ota|بس|tr=bes|t=Enough! Hold!|pos=interj.}},<ref>{{R:ota:Redhouse|بس|page=363}}</ref><ref>{{R:ota:Kelekian|بس|page=265}}</ref> from {{der|tr|fa|بس|tr=bas|t=enough}}.

