Page 2865 Sinae: -------- begin text --------
{{also|sinä}}
==Latin==
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikipedia|lang=la}}
[[File:Ptolemy_Asia_detail.jpg|thumb|250px|An early modern Latin map after Ptolemy, showing SINÆ on the Great Gulf at the eastern end of the landlocked Indian Ocean.]]
[[File:China1740.jpg|thumb|250px|An 18th-century Latin map of [[China proper|China Proper]] (Sinæ Propriæ).]]

===Etymology===
From {{der|la|grc|Σῖναι}} of uncertain etymology, but probably from {{der|la|sa|^चीन||[[China]]}}, possibly via {{der|la|ar|^صِين||[[China]]; the [[Chinese]]}} and usually held to derive from {{der|la|och|^秦||[[Qin]]}}. See "[[w:Names of China#Sinae|Names of China]]" at [[w:Main Page|Wikipedia]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|Sīnae}}

===Proper noun===
{{la-proper noun|Sīnae<1>}}

# {{lb|la|culture}} the [[Chinese]], ''[[specifically]]:''
## {{lb|la|Classical}} the [[southern]] [[Chinese]] [[reach]]ed [[via]] the [[maritime]] [[Silk Road]] to [[Panyu]] ([[Guangzhou]]), not [[known]] [[at the time]] to be [[relate]]d to the ''{{l|la|Seres}}'' [[reach]]ed by the [[overland]] [[route]] to [[Chang'an]] ([[Xi'an]])
## {{lb|la|New Latin}} the [[Chinese]] [[people]]: the [[Han Chinese]] or [[citizen]]s of [[China]].
# the [[land]] of the [[Chinese]], ''[[specifically]]:''
## {{lb|la|Classical}} the [[land]] of the [[southern]] [[Chinese]]
## {{lb|la|New Latin}} {{place|la|t=China|country|r/East Asia|either the [[Republic of China|Republic]] or [[People's Republic of China]]}}

====Declension====
{{la-ndecl|Sīnae<1>}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|Republic of China}} {{l|la|Rēs Pūblica Sīnārum}} {{qualifier|New Latin}}
* {{sense|People’s Republic of China}} {{l|la|Rēs Pūblica Populāris Sīnārum}} {{qualifier|New Latin}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|la|Rēs Pūblica Populāris Sīnārum}}
* {{l|la|Rēs Pūblica Sīnārum}}
* {{l|la|sīno-}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|en|Sino-|Sinese}}

====See also====
* {{l|la|Sēres}}
* {{l|la|Taivania}}
