===Etymology===
{{rfe|lv}}

===Pronunciation===
{{audio|lv|lv-riga-iezis.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{lv-noun|m|2nd}}

# {{lb|lv|chiefly plural|mineralogy|geology}} [[rock]] {{gloss|[[mineral]] [[layer]] on the [[crust]] of the [[Earth]] or of [[other]] [[celestial]] [[body|bodies]]}}
#: {{ux|lv|dolomīta '''ieži'''|dolomite '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|kaļķakmens '''ieži'''|limestone '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|kalnu '''ieži'''|mountain '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|apakšzemes '''ieži'''|underground '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|rūdas '''ieži'''|ore '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|mēness '''ieži'''|moon '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|magmatiskie, metamorfie '''ieži'''|magmatic, metamorphic '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|sedimenta '''ieži''', nogulumu '''ieži''', nogulum'''ieži'''|sediment '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|visa ciemata apkārtne pilna brīnišķīgiem granīta, marmora un citiem '''iežiem'''|all the region of the village (is) full of wonderful granite, marmor and other '''rocks'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|tā kā granīts sastāv no vairākiem minerāliem un... veido veselus kalnus, to vairs nevar saukt par minerālu, bet gan par '''iezi'''... tātad kvarcs, vizla un laukšpats ir minerāli, bet šo minerālu sakopojums - granīts ir jau '''iezis'''|since granite is composed of several minerals and... forms the entire mountain, it can no longer be called a mineral, but a '''rock'''... likewise quartz, mica and feldspat are minerals, but the combination of these minerals - granite - is already a '''rock'''|inline=1}}
# {{lb|lv|in the singular|geography}} [[rock]] {{gloss|[[outcrop]] of [[such]] [[mineral]] [[layer]]s, [[form]]ing a [[steep]] [[slope]]}}
#: {{ux|lv|smilšakmens '''iezis'''|sandstone '''rock'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|sarkanā malā '''iezis'''|red clay '''rock'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|Zvārtes '''iezis'''|Zvārte's rock (in Gauja national park, Latvia)|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
In the sense of "mineral layer", {{m|lv|ieži}} is almost always used in the plural; the singular forms are very infrequent.

====Declension====
{{lv-decl-noun|ie|is|2nd||z|ž|extrawidth=-60}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|lv|akmens}}
* {{l|lv|klints}}
