Page 2909 josla: -------- begin text --------
{{also|joslā}}
==Latvian==

===Etymology===
From the same stem found in {{m|lv|josta||belt}}, {{uder|lv|ine-pro|*yeh₃s-||to girdle}}, but with a different suffix (''-l(a)'' instead of ''-t(a)''). Cognates include {{cog|lt|júoslas||tie, bind, bandage}}, and, with yet another suffix, {{cog|grc|ζώνη||belt, sash, zone}} (from ''*zṓsnā'' from ''*yōs-nā-'').<ref>Karulis, Konstantīns. 1992, 2001. ''Latviešu etimoloģijas vārdnīca.'' Rīga: AVOTS. {{ISBN|9984700127}}.</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{lv-IPA|juôsla|broken}}
{{audio|lv|lv-riga-josla.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{lv-noun|f|4th}}

# [[strip]], [[stripe]] {{gloss|a narrow, elongated part of an object or a surface that differs from its surroundings}}
#: {{ux|lv|krāsu '''joslas''' audumā|red '''stripes''' on a piece of fabric|inline=1}}
# [[strip]] of [[land]], [[strip]]-like part of a [[surface]]
#: {{ux|lv|zemes, tīruma '''josla'''|a land, field '''strip''', '''lot'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|tīrums sadalīts '''joslās'''|the field is divided into '''strips''', '''plots'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|šķēršļu '''josla'''|obstacle '''course''', '''lane'''|inline=1}}
# {{lb|lv|geography}} an [[elongated]] [[area]] in general; [[zone]]; [[area]]
#: {{ux|lv|ekvatoriālā, tropu, subtropu, polārā '''joslā'''|equatorial, tropical, subtropical, polar '''zone'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|laika '''josla''', zona|time '''zone'''|inline=1}}
# [[zone]], [[region]], [[area]] in general, of any form, on the [[ground]], or on a given [[object]]
#: {{ux|lv|stepju '''josla'''|steppe '''area'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|apdraudēta '''josla'''|danger '''zone'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|aizliegtā '''josla'''|forbidden '''zone'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|neitrālā '''josla'''|neutral '''zone'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|apstādījumu '''josla'''|plantation '''area'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|mežu, piejūras '''josla'''|forest, coastal '''area'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|plecu '''josla'''|shoulder '''area''' (part of the body around one's shoulder)|inline=1}}
# {{lb|lv|physics}} [[range]], [[band]] {{gloss|[[variation]] [[interval]] for a [[physical]] [[variable]]}}
#: {{ux|lv|frekvenču '''josla'''|frequency '''range''', '''band'''|inline=1}}

====Declension====
{{lv-decl-noun|josl|a|4th}}

