#: {{ux|lv|'''upes''' pietekas|'''river''' tributaries|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''upes''' ieteka, grīva|'''river''' estuary, mouth|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''upes''' izteka|'''river''' source, headwaters|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''upes''' augštece, lejtece|up'''river''', down'''river'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''upju''' transports|'''fluvial''' transportation|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''upju''' kuģniecība|'''river''' lines|inline=1}}

