Ultimately from {{der|eo|la|currō}}; compare {{cog|it|correre}}, {{cog|fr|courir}}. {{doublet|eo|kursoro}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{eo-IPA|a=Eo-kuri.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{eo-head}}

# {{lb|eo|intransitive}} to [[run]]
#* {{quote-text|eo|year=1908|translator=Adolf Krafft|title=Robinsono Kruso|section=Part IV
|passage=Kriegante, la viroj '''kuris''' tien kaj reen.
|translation=Shouting, the men ran back and forth.}}

====Conjugation====
{{eo-conj|intr=yes}}

====Derived terms====
{{col-auto|eo
|alkuri<t:to run toward>
|antaŭkuri<t:to run ahead (of)>
|antaŭenkuri<t:to run forward>
|forkuri<t:to run away>
|glitkuri<t:to skate>
|kuregi<t:to sprint; to race>
|skikuri<t:to ski>
}}

{{eo BRO|3}}

