==Afrikaans==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|af|baieng}} {{q|dialectal}}
* {{l|af|baing}} {{q|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|af|ms|banyak||many; very}}, likely combining the influence of the unrelated {{cog|nds|bannig||very}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|af|/ˈbajə/}}
* {{audio|af|LL-Q14196 (afr)-Anon1314-baie.wav|Audio}}

===Adverb===
{{head|af|adverb}}

# [[very]], [[much]]
#: {{ux|af|Haar baas is '''baie''' lelik.|Her boss is '''very''' ugly.}}

===Determiner===
{{head|af|determiner}}

# {{q|with positive polarity|when not modified by adverbs}} [[many]], [[much]], [[a lot of]]
#: {{ux|af|Daar is '''baie''' besoekers op die mark.|There are '''many''' visitors at the market.}}
#: {{ux|af|Sy koop '''baie''' tydskrifte in die kiosk.|She is buying '''a lot of''' magazines at the news stand.}}
#: {{ux|af|In die winter stroom '''baie''' water die vlei in.|'''A lot of''' water is flowing into the valley in winter.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|af|veel}} {{q|less common, more or less in complementary distribution}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|af|pronoun}}

# {{q|with positive polarity|when not modified by adverbs}} [[a lot]], [[much]]
#: {{ux|af|Ons het '''baie''' gehad om te bespreek.|We had '''a lot''' to discuss.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|af|veel}} {{q|less common, more or less in complementary distribution}}

