===Etymology===
Suppletive verb; verbal noun from {{inh|br|cel-bry-pro|*monetu}} (compare {{cog|cy|mynd}}, {{cog|kw|mones}}), verbal noun of {{inh|br|cel-pro|*mon-ī-}} (compare {{cog|mga|muinithir||goes around}}), from {{inh|br|ine-pro|*menH-}} (compare {{cog|xum|menes||will come}}, {{cog|lt|mìnti||to trample, scutch}}). Indicative forms from {{der|br|cel-pro|*ageti||to drive}} (compare {{cog|sga|aigid}}), from {{der|br|ine-pro|*h₂eǵ-}} (compare {{cog|la|agō}}). The forms in ''el-'' are from {{der|br|cel-pro|*ɸel-||to approach, drive}}, from {{der|br|ine-pro|*pelh₂-}} (compare {{cog|la|pellō||strike, drive}}, {{cog|grc-epc|πίλναμαι||approach}}.

