==Afrikaans==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|af|sé}} {{q|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|af|nl|zee}}, from {{inh|af|dum|sêe}}, from {{inh|af|odt|sēo}}, from {{inh|af|gem-pro|*saiwiz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|af|/sɪə/|/zɪə/}}
* {{audio|af|LL-Q14196 (afr)-Oesjaar-see.wav|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{af-noun|seë}}

# [[sea]]
#: {{ux|af|Laasweek het ons '''see''' toe gegaan.|Last week we went to the '''sea'''.}}
#: {{ux|af|Die trekvoëls vlieg oor die berge, oor die '''see''', Lapland toe.|The migratory birds are flying over the mountains, over the '''sea''', to Sápmi.}}

