===Etymology 2===
Initialisms.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|mnemonic|emergency medicine}} {{initialism of|en|[[airway]], [[breathing]] and [[circulation]]|dot=:}} the essential steps in the immediate [[assessment]] and [[treatment]] of critically ill or injured [[patient]]s.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2015|author=Marcia Wells|title=Eddie Red Undercover: Mystery in Mayan Mexico|publisher=w:Houghton Mifflin Harcourt|isbn=9780544302068|page={{gbooks|xo-dBAAAQBAJ|180|ABCs}}|passage=I run my hands over his chest, assessing his '''ABCs''': airway, breathing, circulation.}}
# {{lb|en|US}} {{initialism of|en|[[alcoholic]] [[beverage]] [[control]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2011|title=Privatize This? Assessing the Opportunities and Costs of Privatization|author=Richard A. McGowan|chapter=State-Controlled Liquor Stores I: Pennsylvania|location=Santa Barbara|publisher=ABC-CLIO|isbn=9780313375866|page={{gbooks|JoawVQHKQ34C|89|ABC}}|passage=Pennsylvania is one of 18 alcoholic beverage control states, commonly known as “'''ABC''' states.” In an '''ABC''' state, the state government controls the sale and distribution of various alcoholic beverages, depending on state law.}}
# {{senseid|en|American-born Chinese}}{{lb|en|dated|sometimes|derogatory}} {{initialism of|en|[[American]]-[[born]] [[Chinese]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1993|author=Susan Kulkin|title=Speaking Out: Teenagers Take on Race, Sex, and Identity|location=New York|publisher=G.P. Putnam's Sons|isbn=0399223436|page={{gbooks|CkNEoForQ70C|59|ABCs}}|passage=Everyone was Chinese. Some of the students were '''ABCs'''. That means "American-born Chinese." Others were FOBs. FOB means "fresh off the boat" and it is a bad insult. I didn't feel prejudiced about the FOBs because I was one of them.}}
# {{initialism of|en|[[Australian]]-[[born]] [[Chinese]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2004|title=Asian Diasporas: Cultures, Indentity, Representations|editors=Robbie B.H. Goh; Shawn Wong|chapter=Cultural Citizenship in Diaspora: A Study of Chinese Australia|author=Wenche Ommundsen|publisher=Hong Kong University Press|isbn=9622096727|page={{gbooks|FTa-AQAAQBAJ|79|ABC}}|passage=Many argue, with justice, that the differences between the various groups of Chinese-Australians are such that it is impossible to speak in terms of a "cultural identity" common to them all (Ang 2001). On the other hand, the mainstream culture is rarely capable of making such distinctions: in the eyes of most Australians, there is little difference between an '''ABC''' (Australian-born Chinese), an ethnic Chinese from Vietnam, or a mainlander.}}
# {{lb|en|business|_|management}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|activity-based costing}}}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|title=Managing Now|author=Gary Dessler; Jean Phillips|chapter=Planning and Controlling Now: Controlling|publisher=Houghton Mifflin Company|isbn=9780618833474|page={{gbooks|za4HAAAAQBAJ|222|ABC}}|passage=Activity-based costing is a powerful control tool. With '''ABC''', the manager can access all departments and monitor the costs associated with any activity he or she wants to control.}}
# {{lb|en|climbing}} {{initialism of|en|[[advance]] [[base]] [[camp]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1999|title=Across Peaks & Passes in Kumaun Himalaya|author=Harish Kapadia|chapter=Accident and Rescue in the Nanda Devi Sanctuary|location=New Delhi|publisher=Indus Publishing Company|isbn=8173870969|page={{gbooks|nD95LUfpgzgC|69|ABC}}|passage=Boga and Subhash with Sherpa Nim Dorje and Kedar Singh left early to open a route to advance base camp. {{...}} They proceeded south along the left bank of the glacier. They could avoid the moraines by climbing the slopes near the bank. It was a long march and they established '''ABC''' at 4877 m on a small open rocky ground.}}
# {{lb|en|biochemistry}} {{initialism of|en|[[ATP]]-[[binding]] [[cassette]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|title=Encyclopedia of Molecular Pharmacology|editors=Stefan Offermanns; Walter Rosenthal|chapter=Sterol Transporters|author=Gerd Schmitz|edition=2nd|volume=1|publisher=Springer|isbn=9783540389163|page={{gbooks|iwwo5gx8aX8C|1157|ABC}}|passage='''ABC'''-transporters are multispan membrane proteins that mediate the active uptake or efflux of specific substrates across various biological membrane systems. A functional '''ABC'''-transporter protein usually consists of two transmembrane domains and two '''ABCs'''.}}
# {{lb|en|immunology|medicine}} {{initialism of|en|[[antigen]]-[[binding]] [[capacity]]}}
# {{lb|en|disease}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|aneurysmal bone cyst}}}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013|title=Pearls and Pitfalls in Musculoskeletal Imaging: Variants and Other Difficult Diagnoses|editors=D. Lee Bennett; Georges Y. El-Khoury|chapter=Tumors/Miscellaneous: Aneurysmal bone cyst (ABC)|author=Georges Y. El-Khoury|publisher=Cambridge University Press|isbn=9780521196321|page={{gbooks|9aupvNn-gzoC|219|ABC}}|passage=In the long bones, spine, and flat bones, the majority of aneurysmal bone cysts ('''ABCs''') are eccentrically located whereas in the short tubular bones they are usually central in location. {{...}} About 15% of all giant cell tumors have cystic areas that resemble '''ABC''', and in about one third of all '''ABCs''' a pre-existing lesion can be identified.}}
# {{lb|en|disease}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|adenoid basal cell carcinoma}}}}
# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug}} {{abbreviation of|en|abacavir}}
# {{lb|en|pharmacology}} {{initialism of|en|[[accelerated]] [[blood]] [[clearance]]}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|Atanasoff-Berry computer}}}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} {{initialism of|en|artificial bee colony}} 
# {{lb|en|law|finance}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|assignment for the benefit of creditors}}}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|title=Navigating Today's Environment: The Directors' and Officers' Guide to Restructuring|editor=John Wm. Butler, Jr|chapter=Alternatives to bankruptcy|author=Pepper Hamilton|publisher=Globe White Page Ltd|isbn=9781905773084|page={{gbooks|h4i95Pjy2LUC|205|ABC}}|passage=Like foreclosure, an assignment for the benefit of creditors ('''ABC''') is a creature of state law. '''ABCs''' have long been popular in a few states, most notably California and Illinois, but they are beginning to gain traction in other states as a less expensive alternative to bankruptcy.}}
# {{lb|en|electrical engineering}} {{initialism of|en|[[absorbing]] [[boundary condition]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=Nikolaos V. Kantartzis; Theodoros D. Tsiboukis|title=Modern EMC Analysis Techniques I: Time-Domain Computational Schemes|publisher=Morgan & Claypool|isbn=9781598293180|page={{gbooks|1nd4ouSykdoC|180|ABC}}|passage=As a matter of fact, when numerically handling a model originally established on an unbounded domain, it is compulsory to impose the pertinent '''ABC''' to terminate the endless mesh while retaining a well-posed and stable simulation.}}
# {{lb|en|OOP}} {{initialism of|en|[[abstract]] [[base class]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|author=James Coplien; Gertrud Bjørnvig|chapter=What the System ''Is'', Part 2: Coding It Up|title=Lean Architecture for Agile Software Development|publisher=John Wiley & Sons|isbn=9780470684207|page={{gbooks|lpvY36MPMUwC|133|ABCs}}|passage=Abstract base classes ('''ABCs''') represent an interesting paradox. {{...}} It is instructive to think of '''ABCs''' as tools rather than as part of the product.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2022|title=Fluent Python|edition=2nd|author=Luciano Ramalho|publisher=O'Reilly|isbn=978-1492056355|passage=Most '''ABCs''' in the <code>collections.abc</code> module exist to formalize interfaces that are implemented by built-in objects and are implicitly supported by the interpreter—both of which predate the '''ABCs''' themselves.}}
# {{lb|en|psychology}} {{initialism of|en|[[adventure]]-[[based]] [[counseling]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2012|author=Shannon Hodges|chapter=Emerging Fields and Profession in Counseling|title=101 Careers in Counseling|location=New York|publisher=Springer Publishing Company|isbn=9780826108586|page={{gbooks|b8Q-NKbrhEUC|229|ABC}}|passage=Creatively integrating counseling theory, research, and best practices has afforder me the opportunity to constructively engage clients in adventure-based counseling ('''ABC''') activities that foster social, mental, and emotional development. Utilizing '''ABC''' as an innovative counseling approach for individuals, families, and groups has increased my enthusiasm as a counselor.}}
# {{lb|en|psychology}} {{initialism of|en|[[affect]], [[behavior]]{{,}} and [[cognition]]}}
#: {{syn|en|CAB}}
# {{lb|en|cryptozoology}} {{initialism of|en|[[alien]] [[big cat]]}}
# {{lb|en|automotive}} {{initialism of|en|active body control}}
# {{lb|en|Christianity|informal}} {{initialism of|en|{{w|Archbishop of Canterbury}}}}

