==Albanian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sq|sqj-pro|*mar(en)-}}, from {{der|sq|ine-pro|*merh₂-||to pack (up)}} or {{der|sq|ine-pro|*(s)mer-||to assign, allot}}, cognate with {{cog|grc|μείρομαι||receive as one's portion}}, {{cog|la|mereō}}, {{m|la|merx}} and {{cog|hit|||tr=mark|to divide a sacrifice}}.<ref>{{R:sq:Demiraj|page=257-8}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sq|[mar]}}

===Verb===
{{sq-verb|móra|márrë}}

# {{lb|sq|active|transitive}} to [[take]], [[grab]] {{q|someone/something by hand}}
#: {{syn|sq|kap|rrok|zë}}
#: {{ant|sq|jap|lëshoj|liroj}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Po i '''marr''' librat.|I am '''[[take|taking]]''' the books.}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive}} to [[hold]], [[carry]], [[pick]] [[up]] (something)
#: {{syn|sq|mbaj|mbledh}}
#: {{uxi|sq|'''Merr'''e librin në dorë!|'''Pick up''' your book!}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive}} to [[drag]] (someone by the arm, hand, hair); to [[pull]] (someone’s arm, hand, hair); to [[set]]/take [[off]]; to [[kidnap]] someone ([[hostage]]/[[slave]]/[[bride]])
#: {{syn|sq|zvarris|shkul|tëheq|grabis|rrëmbej}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Mos, ose të '''marr''' për flokësh!|Don't, or I'll '''drag''' you by your hair!}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[provide]], [[profit]] (for oneself); to [[equip]] [[oneself]]; to [[make]] (something) [[mine]]
#: {{syn|sq|siguroj|pajisem|përvetësoj}}
#: {{ant|sq|jap|fal}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[receive]] {{q|salary, diploma, patent, title, news, message, wish, blessings, permission}}
#: {{syn|sq|perceptoj|pranoj}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Kur e '''marr''' rrogën?|When will I '''receive''' my salary?}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[take]] [[power]]/[[rule]] over, [[possess]], [[own]], [[win]]
#: {{syn|sq|vendos|sundoj|qeveris|zotëroj|mund}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Ia '''mori''' zemrën.|'''Won''' her/his heart.}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[borrow]]
#: {{syn|sq|huazoj}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[acquire]], [[obtain]] {{q|knowledge, lesson, experience}}
#: {{syn|sq|mësoj|fitoj}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[eat]]; to [[drink]], [[swallow]] (pills), [[suck]]; to [[take]] (drugs, pills, medicine)
#: {{syn|sq|ha|pi|thith}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Po i '''marr''' barnat.|I am '''[[take|taking]]''' my pills.}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[require]](s), [[will]]
#: {{syn|sq|kërkon|do}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|colloquial}} to [[take]] someone as one's [[wife]]/[[bride]]/[[partner]]; to [[make]] someone to one's [[wife]]/[[bride]]
#: {{syn|sq|martohem|fejohem|bashkohem}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|figurative}} to [[cut]], [[trim]], [[remove]] something (from hair, body, etc.)
#: {{syn|sq|pres|shkurtoj|heq}}
#: {{uxi|sq|'''Mora''' anët.|I '''trimmed''' the sides (of my hair).}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive}} to [[agree]], [[take]] something into [[consideration]]
#: {{uxi|sq|'''Merre''' me të mirë!|'''Take/consider''' it positive!}}
#: {{syn|sq|pranoj|pajtohem|përputhem|përshtatem}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[take]]s [[over]] {{q|emotions, feelings, condition, desire, health, illness}}
#: {{uxi|sq|'''Më merr malli''' për ty.|'''I yearn''' for you.|lit='''The yearning takes over me''' for you.}}
#: {{uxi|sq|Të '''marrtë''' dreqi!|'''May''' the devil '''take over''' you! (~ To hell with you!)}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[contain]](s), [[fit]](s) {{q|an amount}}
#: {{syn|sq|nxë|mban|përmban}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive|colloquial|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[summarize]](s); [[include]](s) (law, etc.)
#: {{syn|sq|përmbledh|përfshin}}
# {{lb|sq|active|transitive}} to [[understand]], [[judge]] (someone/something); to [[call]] (something/someone) [[out]]
#: {{syn|sq|kuptoj|gjykoj|quaj}}
# {{lb|sq|active|intransitive}} to [[go]] (direction), take a [[route]]; to [[climb]]/[[got]] up (somewhere)
#: {{syn|sq|shkoj|hipi|arrij}}
# {{lb|sq|active|intransitive|figurative|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[walk]]s towards, [[reach]](es) (development)
#: {{syn|sq|arrin}}
# {{lb|sq|active|intransitive|figurative|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[start]]s, [[begin]](s) {{q|also as a [[semi-auxiliary]] verb}}
#: {{syn|sq|nis|fillon|përhap}}
# {{lb|sq|active|intransitive|figurative|3rd pers.}} (it/they) [[catch]](es), [[get]]s; (it/they) [[is]]/[[are]] [[getting]] {{q|weather, condition}}
#: {{syn|sq|bëhet}}
# {{lb|sq|active}} to [[take]] (over) + [[substantive]]/noun
#: {{non-gloss definition|Forms together with substantive verbs/verbal phrases. Meaning of verb derives from the respective substantive:}}
#: {{compound|sq|hak|marr|-em|tr1=revenge|tr2=take/taking|tr3=I (am)}}
#:: → {{l|sq|hakmerrem||to revenge, avenge}}
#:: (''“I take revenge”'')
#: {{l|sq|marr||to take}} + {{l|sq|vesh||ear}}
#:: → {{l|sq|marr vesh||to understand, listen; to hear, find out}}
#: See also: {{l|sq|marrëveshje||agreement, deal, arrangement, understanding, etc.|g=f}}, {{l|sq|mosmarrëveshje||disagreement, misunderstanding, dispute|g=f}}
#: {{l|sq|marr||to take}} + {{l|sq|frymë||breath}}
#:: → {{l|sq|marr frymë||to breathe|lit=to take breath}}
#: See also: {{l|sq|frymëmarrje||breathing|g=f}}
#: {{l|sq|marr||to take}} + {{l|sq|erë||scent, smell, odor}}
#:: → {{l|sq|marr erë||to smell|lit=to take smell, scent}}
# {{lb|sq|active|intransitive|colloquial|third person}} to [[interfere]], [[conceive]]
#: {{syn|sq|ndërzehet|mbarset}}
# {{lb|sq|passive|reflexive|third person}} to [[go]] [[away]], to [[lose]], to [[disappear]]
#: {{syn|sq|ik|largohet|humb|humbet|zhduket}}

