# {{lb|pl|countable|education}} [[mark]], [[grade]], [[score]] {{gl|review of performance}} {{+preo|pl|z|gen|means=in what subject}}
#: {{uxi|pl|W szkole zawsze miałam dobre '''stopnie'''.|I always had good '''grades''' at school.}}
# {{transclude sense|pl|degree|id=physics|lb=countable}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Jutro ma być dwanaście '''stopni'''.|It's supposed to be twelve '''degrees''' tomorrow.}}
# {{transclude sense|pl|degree|id=geometry|lb=countable}}
#: {{uxi|pl|Ta trasa nie jest zbyt trudna, ma nachylenie mniej niż 30 '''stopni'''.|This route is not very hard, it has a slope of less than 30 '''degrees'''.}}
# {{transclude sense|pl|degree of comparison|id=comparative|lb=countable}}
