===Etymology===
{{inh+|pt|roa-opt|braço}}, from {{inh|pt|la|brachium}}, {{m|la|bracchium}}, from {{der|pt|grc|βραχίων||arm}}, from {{m|grc|βραχύς||short}}, from {{der|pt|ine-pro|*mréǵʰus||short, brief}}. Compare {{cog|gl|brazo}}, {{cog|es|brazo}}, {{cog|ca|braç}}, {{cog|ro|braț}}, and {{cog|it|braccio}}.

