{{pt-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|pt|asu|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|pt|bra|ço}}
* {{audio|pt|LL-Q5146 (por)-Santamarcanda-braço.wav|Audio (Oporto, Portugal)}}

===Noun===
{{pt-noun|m}}

# {{senseid|pt|upper limb}} [[arm]] {{gloss|upper limb}}
#* {{RQ:mul:Rowling Harry Potter|pt-BR|6|page=100|text=Hermione beliscou o '''braço''' do amigo com força.|t=Hermione pinched her friend's arm with force.}}
# {{senseid|pt|upper arm}} {{lb|pt|specifically}} [[upper arm]]; [[brachium]] {{gloss|part of the arm between the elbow and shoulder}}
# {{senseid|pt|any limb}} {{lb|pt|loosely}} any [[limb]] or [[tentacle]]
# {{senseid|pt|part for the arm}} [[arm]] {{gloss|part of an object designed to be used with the arm}}
## {{senseid|pt|sleeve}} [[arm]]; [[sleeve]] {{gloss|part of an item of clothing for the upper body that goes around the arm}}
## {{senseid|pt|arm of furniture}} [[arm]] {{gloss|part of a furniture for sitting that one can rest one’s arm on}}
# {{senseid|pt|extension}} [[arm]] {{gloss|anything that extends out from another thing}}
## {{senseid|pt|neck of an instrument}} {{lb|pt|musical instruments}} [[neck]] {{gloss|extended part of a stringed instrument}}
## {{senseid|pt|inlet}} {{lb|pt|geography}} [[arm]]; [[inlet]] {{gloss|small part of a body of water extending out from the main body}}
## {{senseid|pt|mountain range extension}} {{lb|pt|geography}} a smaller range extending from a [[mountain range]]
## {{senseid|pt|part of a lever}} {{lb|pt|mechanics}} the part of a [[lever]] on either side of the [[fulcrum]]
## {{senseid|pt|arm of a chromosome}} {{lb|pt|genetics}} [[arm]] {{gloss|part of a chromosome extending from the centromere}}
## {{senseid|pt|arm of a galaxy}} {{lb|pt|astronomy}} [[arm]] {{gloss|outer part of a spiral galaxy}}
