====Noun====
{{tpw-noun|p|IId}}

# [[path]]; [[way]]
#: {{ux|tpw|Xe ruba '''rapé'''|My father's '''path'''}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The word ''pé'' is used when referring to who goes through the path, who "owns" it — e.g. ''tatu ra'''pé''''' (“armadillo's path”); {{m|tpw|piara}} is used when referring to where the path leads to — e.g. ''ybaka '''piara''''' (“the path to heaven”).<ref>{{R:pt:Navarro Método|3|394|30|522}}</ref>

