* Czech: {{t|cs|chroustat}}
* Danish: {{t|da|gnaske}}
* German: {{t+|de|schmatzen}}
* Hungarian: {{t+|hu|csámcsog}}
* Maori: {{t|mi|katikati}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|ча́вкать|impf}}, {{t+|ru|ча́вкнуть|pf}}
* Scots: {{t|sco|champ}}
{{trans-bottom}}

