* French: {{t+|fr|cône spot|m}}
* Russian: {{t+|ru|тубус|m}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To behave disdainfully toward someone. {{rfex|en}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|theatre|photography}} To apply a snoot attachment to (a light).
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2011|author=Joe McNally|title=Sketching Light
|passage=Which might mean shaping it, gelling it, '''snooting''' it, barn dooring it, and putting it on a stand or a clamp. Maybe taking the dome diffuser off. Perhaps zooming it. Oh my. And you thought you were just taking a picture.}}

