Page 3525 ocean: -------- begin text --------
{{also|Ocean|océan|óceán|oceán|oċean}}
==English==
[[File:Indianocean.PNG|thumb|A map with the Indian Ocean in dark blue]]

===Etymology===
{{dercat|en|qsb-grc|ine-pro}}
From {{inh|en|enm|*ocean}}, {{m|enm|occean}}, {{m|enm|occian}}, {{m|enm|occyan}}, from {{der|en|fro|occean}} (later reborrowed or reinforced by {{der|en|frm|ocean}}), from {{der|en|la|Ōceanus}}, originally from {{der|en|grc|Ὠκεανός||Oceanus|pos=a water deity}}. Displaced native {{ncog|ang|gārseċġ}}.

Also commonly referred to as ''the ocean sea'', ''the sea of ocean'' (compare Latin ''mare ōceanum''; Old French ''mer oceane'', ''occeanne mer''). Compare {{cog|stq|Oceoan||ocean}}, {{cog|fy|oseaan||ocean}}, {{cog|nl|oceaan||ocean}}, {{cog|nds-de|Ozeaan||ocean}}, {{cog|de|Ozean||ocean}}, {{cog|da|ocean||ocean}}, {{cog|sv|ocean||ocean}}, {{cog|fr|océan||ocean}}, {{cog|it|oceano||ocean}}. {{dbt|en|Oceanus}}/{{m|en|Okeanos}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈəʊ.ʃən/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈoʊ.ʃən/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-ocean.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|əʊʃən|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|en|o|cean}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} One of the large bodies of [[water]] separating the continents.
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} Water belonging to an ocean.
#: {{ux|en|The island is surrounded by '''ocean'''}}
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} An immense expanse; any vast space or quantity without apparent limits.
#: {{ux|en|the boundless '''ocean''' of eternity}}
#: {{ux|en|an '''ocean''' of difference}}
#* {{RQ:Dickens David Copperfield|passage=On the present occasion, Traddles was so hemmed in by the pagoda and the guitar-case, and Dora’s flower-painting, and my writing-table, that I had serious doubts of the possibility of his using his knife and fork; but he protested, with his own good-humour, ‘'''Oceans''' of room, Copperfield! I assure you, '''Oceans'''!’}}
# A [[blue]] [[colour]], like that of the ocean (also called ocean blue).
#: {{color panel|138FCF}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|large body of water}} the [[ogin]] {{qualifier|UK|nautical and navy}}

====Hyponyms====
{{col4
|en|Antarctic Ocean
|Atlantic Ocean
|Austral Ocean
|German Ocean
|Indian Ocean
|Pacific Ocean
|South Polar Ocean
|Southern Ocean
}}

