Page 3535 جزيرة: -------- begin text --------
{{also|جزیره|جزیرہ}}
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}
==Arabic==

===Etymology===
Of the root {{ar-root|ج ز ر}}. Likely an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} topographic term, to be identified with {{cog|tmr|גזרתא|t=a heap or slab of wood or stone}} and {{cog|syc|ܓܙܺܝܪܬܴ݁ܐ|tr=gəzīrtā|t=a heap or slab of wood or stone; merlon; door-ring, ''specifically Mesopotamia''}}, with the specific meaning of “island” but attested as {{cog|syc|ܓܳܙܰܪܬܴ݁ܐ|tr=gāzartā}} and {{cog|xcl|կղզի}} and {{cog|oge|კუნძული}}; potentially reinterpreted from the {{der|ar|sux|-}} source of {{m|ar|جِسْر|t=(wooden) bridge}}, though {{cog|sem|-}} root derivation is superficially very plausible—from this root {{ar-root|ج ز ر}} / {{m|arc|ג־ז־ר}} / {{syc-root|ܓ|ܙ|ܪ}} related to “cutting, cheffing” one hardly has obtained the meaning of “an island” or “a major separated region” ''directly'' but rather by means of transferral from “smaller” meanings.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|جَزِيرَة}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-جزيرة.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|جَزِيرَة|f|pl=جَزَائِر|pl2=جُزُر}}

# [[island]]
# [[peninsula]]
# [[area]], [[region]], [[territory]], [[section]], [[district]]; any [[separate]]d [[location]], especially one [[delimit]]ed by [[natural]] [[boundary|boundaries]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|جَزِيرَة|pl=جَزَائِر|pl2=جُزُر}}

