===Proper noun===
{{head|mul|proper noun}}

# {{lb|mul|geology|astronomy|obsolete}} {{former name of|mul|Yamor Mons}} {{qualifier|2015-2017}}, {place|mul|a <<mountain>> on [[Ceres]], a [[dwarf planet]] found in the {{w|lang=en|Main Asteroid Belt}}}}.

====Usage notes====
The name was changed after the discovery of the fact that the festival that the feature was named after was a hoax.
