# [[tract]], [[quarter]], [[low]] land
# [[blame]], [[attribution]] of [[vice]], [[reproach]], [[reputation]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=[[w:Abu Nuwas|Abū Nuwās]]|title=[[s:ar:طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى واصْطبحْ|{{lang|ar|طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى واصْطبحْ}}]]|year=c. 800
|passage=طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى، واصْطبحْ<br/>من عُقارٍ تُنهبُ الهمّ الفَرَحْ<br/>أخَذتْ من كلّ شيءٍ لَوْنَهــا،<br/>هي في ناجودها قوْسُ قُزَحْ<br/>شيْخُ لذّاتٍ، نقِيٌّ عِرْضُهُ،<br/>تحْسُنُ الأشعارُ فيه، والمِدَحْ.<br/>لا تراهُ الدّهْرُ إلاّ ثَمِلاً،<br/>بينَ إبْريقٍ، وزِقٍّ، وقدَحْ
|translation=The shaykh gleed and sang and craved more booze<br/>forthy delight removes the sorrow.<br/>He obtained from every thing its hues<br/>and his cup exposed a rainbow.<br/>Shaykh of bliss, no way '''blammed''',<br/>The notes of him are merry, fele to plaud,<br/>Fate sees him not but slammed,<br/>betwixe ewer and wineskin, beaker-pawed.
|tr=ṭariba aš-šayḵu fa-ġannā, wa-iṣṭabaḥ<br/>min ʿuqārin tunhabu l-hamma l-faraḥ<br/>ʾaḵaḏat min kulli šayʾin lawna-hā<br/>hiya fī nājūdi-hā qawsu quzaḥ.<br/>šayḵu laḏḏātin, naqiyyun '''ʿirḍu'''-hū<br/>taḥsunu al-ʾašʿāru fī-hi, wa-l-midaḥ,<br/>la tarā-hu ad-dahru illā ṯamilan,<br/>bayna ʾibrīqin, wa-ziqqin, wa-qadaḥ.<br/>}}

