#: {{syn|vi|rặng núi|qq1=literary|mạch núi|qq2=literary|sơn mạch|qq3=literary, rare}}

====Usage notes====
* Often shortened to just {{m|vi|dãy}}, especially before the actual name of the range. For example, "''dãy'' Himalaya" ("the Himalayas") is more common than "''dãy núi'' Himalaya".
* ''Dãy núi'' (and the shortened {{m|vi|dãy}}) is the usual term for "mountain range" in Vietnamese, and the only one that has frequent usage in spoken Vietnamese.

